    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play for Free. Survive the Cartoon Apocalypse.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tooncop</i> is a <strong>fast-paced, first-person horde shooter prototype</strong> where you take on waves of chaotic, rogue cartoon enemies spilling into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no pay-to-win, no microtransactions, and no cosmetic grinding\u2014just raw arcade-style gameplay focused on survival, score chasing, and moment-to-moment chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run gives you <strong>15 minutes</strong> to survive increasingly aggressive enemy waves, collect XP, chain power-ups, and push for high scores. The game is designed to be simple, snappy, and satisfying\u2014with a growing emphasis on <strong>muscle memory and flow state combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're testing your reflexes or just blasting rogue Pomchis for fun, <i>Tooncop</i> is all about gameplay first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 This is an early prototype created by a solo developer. Expect frequent updates, new maps, and evolving mechanics as the project grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play now for free on Steam and help shape what comes next.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play for Free. Survive the Cartoon Apocalypse.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tooncop</i> is a <strong>fast-paced, first-person horde shooter prototype</strong> where you take on waves of chaotic, rogue cartoon enemies spilling into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no pay-to-win, no microtransactions, and no cosmetic grinding\u2014just raw arcade-style gameplay focused on survival, score chasing, and moment-to-moment chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run gives you <strong>15 minutes</strong> to survive increasingly aggressive enemy waves, collect XP, chain power-ups, and push for high scores. The game is designed to be simple, snappy, and satisfying\u2014with a growing emphasis on <strong>muscle memory and flow state combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're testing your reflexes or just blasting rogue Pomchis for fun, <i>Tooncop</i> is all about gameplay first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 This is an early prototype created by a solo developer. Expect frequent updates, new maps, and evolving mechanics as the project grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play now for free on Steam and help shape what comes next.</strong></p>",
